START
   ↓
Input sorted array and search element
   ↓
Call binarySearch(low, high)
   ↓
low > high?
 ├── YES → Return -1
 │           ↓
 │     Element Not Found
 │           ↓
 │          END
 │
 └── NO
       ↓
Calculate mid
       ↓
A[mid] == key?
 ├── YES → Return mid
 │           ↓
 │     Element Found
 │           ↓
 │          END
 │
 └── NO
       ↓
key < A[mid]?
 ├── YES → binarySearch(low, mid - 1)
 │
 └── NO  → binarySearch(mid + 1, high)
             ↓
        Continue Recursion